            description: "Fruit Notes describes Oriole as a yellow-fleshed freestone peach with fruit buds as hardy as Greensboro, medium fruit with firm flesh and good quality, a vigorous tree that bears young and heavily, and a need for very heavy thinning because it can overset and ripen unevenly"
