            harvest_time_unparsed: "18 days before Elberta",
            description: "Fruit Notes describes Veteran as a Vineland, Ontario yellow-fleshed freestone Elberta-type peach with better quality than Elberta, medium to large attractive fruit, occasional cling tendency, and a useful combination of bud hardiness, yellow flesh, productivity, and fair flavor"
